1
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:35,000
[AWAKEN]

2
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:37,920
[Episode 18]

3
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:38,789
Chen Kailai,

4
00:01:39,509 --> 00:01:42,070
for your contribution
to eliminating Communist spies,

5
00:01:42,070 --> 00:01:43,590
you are awarded a medal.

6
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:07,650
Seeing you get rewarded

7
00:02:08,590 --> 00:02:11,250
makes me happier
than getting rewarded myself.

8
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:13,590
Why?

9
00:02:14,150 --> 00:02:15,840
Because I'm your mentor.

10
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:19,040
I got credit because of your influence.

11
00:02:19,150 --> 00:02:20,829
How can I face others in the future?

12
00:02:20,829 --> 00:02:21,829
I have my pride.

13
00:02:25,430 --> 00:02:26,390
You know what?

14
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:29,260
Favors are more fragile than your pride.

15
00:02:30,750 --> 00:02:32,350
With this bronze medal,

16
00:02:33,030 --> 00:02:34,800
you'll have

17
00:02:35,750 --> 00:02:37,310
a bright future at No. 76.

18
00:02:39,430 --> 00:02:40,870
I'm just a photographer.

19
00:02:40,870 --> 00:02:42,120
Why do I need that?

20
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:45,000
People live for a bright future.

21
00:02:45,020 --> 00:02:45,900
Otherwise,

22
00:02:46,329 --> 00:02:47,730
it's just a waste of time.

23
00:02:51,150 --> 00:02:51,840
Look.

24
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:58,190
Only the dead don't need it.

25
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:10,830
Come on in.

26
00:03:37,150 --> 00:03:38,210
Leifeng Pagoda...

27
00:03:44,150 --> 00:03:46,210
Leifeng Pagoda sacrificed himself.

28
00:03:58,630 --> 00:04:01,160
It's not easy
for two people to come together.

29
00:04:01,190 --> 00:04:02,390
There are some things

30
00:04:04,910 --> 00:04:06,440
you should tell her sooner.

31
00:04:10,430 --> 00:04:12,560
I'll tell her when she returns safely.

32
00:04:14,050 --> 00:04:16,380
If I'd known it was the last time
we'd meet,

33
00:04:20,130 --> 00:04:22,260
I would've asked him to stay for a meal.

34
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,390
He loved you.

35
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:27,560
He loved his ideals

36
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,000
and faith.

37
00:04:42,370 --> 00:04:43,250
I'm ready.

38
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,240
I will die too.

39
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,170
You must stay alive.

40
00:05:23,070 --> 00:05:23,780
For him,

41
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,000
and for yourself.

42
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,160
Newspapers!

43
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,750
Newspapers!

44
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:22,630
Newspapers!

45
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:27,540
I've found Du Huangqiao's place.

46
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,690
What are you going to do?

47
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:31,800
Kill him.

48
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,830
To avenge Zhao Qian?

49
00:06:36,430 --> 00:06:38,630
He'll make a move on you sooner or later.

50
00:06:39,159 --> 00:06:41,159
Now is not a good time to strike.

51
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,830
We can give the address
to the Hurricane Team.

52
00:06:43,830 --> 00:06:44,430
Enough.

53
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:51,090
We came all the way
from the Northeast to Nanjing.

54
00:06:51,630 --> 00:06:53,070
All this time,

55
00:06:54,070 --> 00:06:56,070
it wasn't just to kill Du Huangqiao.

56
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:31,470
Son of a bitch!

57
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:01,270
The comrades around us

58
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:05,190
have left us one by one.

59
00:08:11,870 --> 00:08:12,720
Fortunately,

60
00:08:14,390 --> 00:08:15,790
you've always been here.

61
00:08:19,990 --> 00:08:21,990
I won't allow you to leave before me.

62
00:08:54,270 --> 00:08:55,800
I look so ugly in this photo.

63
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,200
Not just ugly.

64
00:09:00,550 --> 00:09:01,550
This photo

65
00:09:02,210 --> 00:09:03,610
might cost you your life.

66
00:09:07,270 --> 00:09:08,870
You only have one way out now.

67
00:09:09,750 --> 00:09:10,390
What?

68
00:09:11,510 --> 00:09:12,420
Become my man.

69
00:09:13,270 --> 00:09:13,910
What?

70
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,890
Become one of us.

71
00:09:28,910 --> 00:09:29,970
If you don't agree,

72
00:09:31,510 --> 00:09:33,570
it'll be hard for me to save your life.

73
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:38,480
Tao Dachun could kill you at any moment

74
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:40,360
for being a traitor.

75
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,200
I'm not a traitor.

76
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:47,970
That's not up to you.

77
00:09:48,230 --> 00:09:50,420
That's a label Du Huangqiao put on me!

78
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:53,170
Do you remember Shasha,

79
00:09:54,340 --> 00:09:55,600
who helped you before?

80
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,750
That bastard Du Huangqiao.

81
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:01,660
He sent several men to gang-rape her,

82
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:03,830
driving her to her death.

83
00:10:10,070 --> 00:10:10,880
Let go of me!

84
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:13,710
Let go of me!

85
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:16,600
Get out! Don't touch me!

86
00:10:31,050 --> 00:10:32,010
Cang Guanglian,

87
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:34,360
you liar.

88
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:39,100
You said you'd take care of me
for the rest of my life.

89
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,390
He did that?

90
00:11:00,910 --> 00:11:02,200
I told you before

91
00:11:03,490 --> 00:11:06,420
that staying with this kind of person
won't end well.

92
00:11:09,270 --> 00:11:10,080
Unless...

93
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:11,840
you become mine.

94
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:14,850
That's the only way you'll stay alive.

95
00:11:31,630 --> 00:11:33,550
Alright, I agree.

96
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:39,320
That's more like it.

97
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:49,690
What do you need me to do?

98
00:11:52,510 --> 00:11:54,110
The Japanese have a project.

99
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:55,710
What is it?

100
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:58,260
It's called Project Slumber.

101
00:12:00,790 --> 00:12:02,520
Is it the one related to Ishida?

102
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:05,120
Yes.

103
00:12:07,870 --> 00:12:08,960
Ishida is dead.

104
00:12:09,910 --> 00:12:11,710
I don't know any other Japanese.

105
00:12:14,790 --> 00:12:16,320
Su Men and Du Huangqiao

106
00:12:16,610 --> 00:12:18,850
both have connections with the Japanese.

107
00:12:18,850 --> 00:12:20,150
You just need to stay by their side

108
00:12:20,150 --> 00:12:21,550
and gather information.

109
00:12:22,670 --> 00:12:23,320
Remember,

110
00:12:24,030 --> 00:12:25,090
don't mess around.

111
00:12:25,740 --> 00:12:28,140
Staying alive is the most important thing.

112
00:12:56,910 --> 00:12:57,510
Hello.

113
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:58,480
Director Li,

114
00:12:59,300 --> 00:13:01,380
I heard some bad news about you.

115
00:13:02,550 --> 00:13:03,110
Tell me.

116
00:13:03,800 --> 00:13:07,790
[Asamizawa,
Japanese Plum Blossom Agency Agent]

117
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:07,750
They found Yu Yingxiang's ledger.

118
00:13:09,250 --> 00:13:09,890
Who did it?

119
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:12,550
That woman from Nanjing.

120
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:23,630
What is this?

121
00:13:24,550 --> 00:13:27,350
The negatives of the photos
I took of you last time.

122
00:13:29,040 --> 00:13:29,950
Also...

123
00:13:30,790 --> 00:13:32,220
I promised Jinbao

124
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:35,100
to keep an eye on Project Slumber for her.

125
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:37,120
Maybe this way I can learn something

126
00:13:37,550 --> 00:13:39,150
about the NBIS's movements.

127
00:13:42,390 --> 00:13:43,520
That's a good thing.

128
00:13:44,550 --> 00:13:47,280
The Hurricane Team
won't try to kill you anymore.

129
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:51,460
But you need to be more careful
in the future.

130
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:53,820
You'll be playing 3 roles at once.

131
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:55,880
I know.

132
00:13:56,750 --> 00:13:57,840
But only one of them

133
00:13:58,360 --> 00:13:59,360
is the real me.

134
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:00,870
No.

135
00:14:01,270 --> 00:14:02,330
You must remember,

136
00:14:02,640 --> 00:14:03,690
all three are you.

137
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:05,860
That's how you play them well.

138
00:14:18,510 --> 00:14:19,840
Su Causeway is leaving.

139
00:14:21,070 --> 00:14:22,270
Go say goodbye to her.

140
00:14:53,870 --> 00:14:54,510
Sister.

141
00:15:03,390 --> 00:15:04,320
Long time no see.

142
00:15:06,030 --> 00:15:07,150
We will meet again.

143
00:15:09,300 --> 00:15:11,430
Someone once said we would meet again,

144
00:15:12,390 --> 00:15:13,790
but I never saw him again.

145
00:15:16,150 --> 00:15:17,120
So this time,

146
00:15:17,670 --> 00:15:19,080
I don't want to say that.

147
00:15:21,790 --> 00:15:23,320
If I leave and never return,

148
00:15:24,720 --> 00:15:25,910
then so be it.

149
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:29,620
The future is unknown.

150
00:15:30,910 --> 00:15:32,710
I will remember you as you are now

151
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:34,730
and think of you as you were.

152
00:15:36,790 --> 00:15:38,120
What we're doing now

153
00:15:38,600 --> 00:15:39,960
is for the future.

154
00:15:41,670 --> 00:15:43,530
Then we will definitely succeed.

155
00:15:47,360 --> 00:15:48,890
Let me take a picture of you.

156
00:15:49,280 --> 00:15:50,610
Why take a picture of me?

157
00:15:51,790 --> 00:15:52,720
Your camera

158
00:15:52,810 --> 00:15:55,710
should capture
the most beautiful things in the world.

159
00:15:55,710 --> 00:15:58,400
What is "all the beauty in the world"?

160
00:15:59,870 --> 00:16:01,270
The most beautiful thing

161
00:16:02,150 --> 00:16:03,000
is peace.

162
00:16:04,300 --> 00:16:04,970
I remember.

163
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:07,360
The most beautiful thing

164
00:16:07,990 --> 00:16:08,910
is peace.

165
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:37,150
Sister!

166
00:16:37,870 --> 00:16:38,550
Sister!

167
00:16:39,270 --> 00:16:40,200
Wait for me!

168
00:16:40,670 --> 00:16:41,240
Sister!

169
00:16:41,720 --> 00:16:42,320
Sister!

170
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:43,600
Wait for me!

171
00:16:44,030 --> 00:16:44,910
Wait for me!

172
00:16:49,090 --> 00:16:49,830
If you leave now,

173
00:16:49,830 --> 00:16:50,860
what about the wedding?

174
00:16:50,860 --> 00:16:52,120
That's not what I want.

175
00:16:52,270 --> 00:16:53,870
I want to make my own choices.

176
00:16:54,080 --> 00:16:55,200
Where are you going?

177
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:56,000
I don't know!

178
00:16:56,150 --> 00:16:57,360
Will you come back?

179
00:16:57,960 --> 00:16:58,790
Thank you!

180
00:17:01,030 --> 00:17:02,550
Where can I find you?

181
00:17:25,829 --> 00:17:27,829
We can't keep Su Men around anymore.

182
00:17:29,270 --> 00:17:31,790
She is protected
by the Japanese and Nanjing.

183
00:17:31,790 --> 00:17:33,120
Confronting her openly

184
00:17:34,030 --> 00:17:35,920
might leave us vulnerable.

185
00:17:44,030 --> 00:17:46,030
Then let's use someone else to do it.

186
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:52,160
The tickets are booked.

187
00:17:52,160 --> 00:17:54,690
We're leaving for Nanjing
tomorrow morning.

188
00:17:55,510 --> 00:17:56,160
Got it.

189
00:18:01,700 --> 00:18:02,260
Come in.

190
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:09,310
How are the preparations?

191
00:18:09,310 --> 00:18:09,920
Boss.

192
00:18:10,220 --> 00:18:12,960
I've even thought of
the headline for tomorrow's tabloid.

193
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:15,030
It will be called "A Tragic Beauty:

194
00:18:15,430 --> 00:18:18,220
Nanjing Inspector Shot Dead by Bandit."

195
00:18:21,110 --> 00:18:21,720
Good.

196
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:26,260
Then tomorrow,

197
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:29,530
I'll have to buy a few more newspapers.

198
00:18:29,730 --> 00:18:30,730
Sure thing, Boss.

199
00:18:47,830 --> 00:18:48,630
Inspector Su.

200
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:10,960
General Kagesa,

201
00:19:11,160 --> 00:19:13,110
may I have this dance?

202
00:19:17,830 --> 00:19:18,590
Yes,

203
00:19:19,550 --> 00:19:20,310
you may.

204
00:19:25,650 --> 00:19:27,650
Du Huangqiao is acting weird today.

205
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:31,440
What's wrong?

206
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:33,070
I heard him say,

207
00:19:33,310 --> 00:19:34,440
"Nanjing Inspector

208
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:36,110
Shot Dead by Bandit."

209
00:19:36,650 --> 00:19:37,480
Be careful.

210
00:19:56,130 --> 00:19:56,810
Captain Du.

211
00:20:03,350 --> 00:20:07,010
The Green Gang has an operation
in the French Concession tonight.

212
00:20:07,990 --> 00:20:09,250
They are coming for me.

213
00:20:23,550 --> 00:20:24,510
Go home now

214
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:25,940
and move the stuff.

215
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:29,550
What about you?

216
00:20:31,180 --> 00:20:31,940
Go quickly.

217
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:43,680
Follow Cui Enxi.

218
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:44,570
Yes.

219
00:21:12,630 --> 00:21:14,230
-Director Li.
-Director Li.

220
00:21:15,640 --> 00:21:16,500
How is it going?

221
00:21:17,920 --> 00:21:19,120
Everything is ready.

222
00:21:30,550 --> 00:21:33,200
Inspector Su,
you're usually the first to leave.

223
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:35,650
You seem to be in high spirits today.

224
00:21:38,440 --> 00:21:40,170
I can't always spoil the fun.

225
00:21:47,750 --> 00:21:48,510
However,

226
00:21:49,190 --> 00:21:52,700
the dance floor only shines
with you on it.

227
00:21:54,590 --> 00:21:56,160
We've known each other for so long,

228
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:56,960
yet I...

229
00:21:57,550 --> 00:21:59,480
have never danced with you.

230
00:22:05,400 --> 00:22:08,120
It's because you have never invited me.

231
00:22:12,110 --> 00:22:12,720
Please.

232
00:22:27,310 --> 00:22:29,070
It's because you're too noble,

233
00:22:29,740 --> 00:22:32,070
and a blind man like me
isn't worthy of you.

234
00:22:33,160 --> 00:22:35,360
Then who gave you the courage this time?

235
00:22:39,040 --> 00:22:39,930
Mr. Zhao.

236
00:22:44,470 --> 00:22:46,190
It was Mr. Zhao who told me

237
00:22:47,510 --> 00:22:50,110
that life is unpredictable,

238
00:22:51,560 --> 00:22:54,360
all is vanity,

239
00:22:55,240 --> 00:22:58,520
and one must enjoy life while they can.

240
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:02,840
Captain Du, you're a nostalgic person.

241
00:23:03,510 --> 00:23:04,970
Aren't you, Inspector Su?

242
00:23:07,830 --> 00:23:09,960
Nostalgia easily breaks one's heart.

243
00:23:11,630 --> 00:23:13,830
Since Mr. Zhao is no longer with us,

244
00:23:14,660 --> 00:23:15,920
I'll be bold enough...

245
00:23:18,180 --> 00:23:20,210
to escort you home.

246
00:23:23,270 --> 00:23:24,190
Don't bother.

247
00:23:25,750 --> 00:23:27,310
I think it's better for you

248
00:23:27,330 --> 00:23:28,590
to find a dancing girl.

249
00:23:39,170 --> 00:23:39,810
Move!

250
00:23:39,840 --> 00:23:41,170
Move! Get out of the way!

251
00:23:45,110 --> 00:23:46,070
Ms. Su Men.

252
00:23:46,350 --> 00:23:47,510
We suspect you

253
00:23:47,510 --> 00:23:49,790
are involved
in a case we are investigating.

254
00:23:49,790 --> 00:23:51,270
Please come with us.

255
00:23:55,260 --> 00:23:56,060
Detective.

256
00:23:57,480 --> 00:23:59,790
This is No. 76's turf.

257
00:24:00,160 --> 00:24:02,030
What kind of huge case is it

258
00:24:02,510 --> 00:24:04,910
that you need
to take our Inspector Su away?

259
00:24:06,400 --> 00:24:07,160
Captain Du,

260
00:24:07,750 --> 00:24:09,610
I am investigating under orders.

261
00:24:09,720 --> 00:24:10,590
No comment.

262
00:24:18,030 --> 00:24:18,640
Let's go.

263
00:24:19,850 --> 00:24:20,780
I'll cooperate.

264
00:24:23,110 --> 00:24:24,030
Move, move!

265
00:24:50,950 --> 00:24:51,630
Continue!

266
00:24:59,920 --> 00:25:00,920
What should we do?

267
00:25:01,720 --> 00:25:03,920
She already knows about our operation.

268
00:25:04,970 --> 00:25:06,370
We can't leave her alive.

269
00:28:18,180 --> 00:28:19,550
Come on, charge over!

270
00:30:42,080 --> 00:30:47,240
♪ This road is so very long ♪

271
00:30:44,160 --> 00:30:45,710
I'm your bodyguard.

272
00:30:46,400 --> 00:30:47,830
I'll protect you from now on.

273
00:30:47,720 --> 00:30:54,490
♪ I don't seem to have done enough ♪

274
00:30:53,280 --> 00:30:54,370
Go!

275
00:30:56,280 --> 00:31:00,810
♪ I follow the warmth
of a heart held close ♪

276
00:30:57,510 --> 00:30:59,000
Go!

277
00:31:02,970 --> 00:31:08,830
♪ Moving on without looking back ♪

278
00:31:10,340 --> 00:31:15,570
♪ I have so many things to tell you ♪

279
00:31:15,910 --> 00:31:19,070
♪ But I don't think I can give you ♪

280
00:31:19,090 --> 00:31:22,030
♪ The answer you want ♪

281
00:31:23,040 --> 00:31:25,780
♪ Don't let yourself grieve too much ♪

282
00:31:26,710 --> 00:31:30,280
♪ When you wake,
the sun will shine again ♪

283
00:31:31,240 --> 00:31:38,740
♪ At the end of the road,
I'll be facing the way we came from ♪

284
00:31:40,350 --> 00:31:46,600
♪ This love, to you and me ♪

285
00:31:47,330 --> 00:31:50,080
♪ Is as light is to the night ♪

286
00:31:50,950 --> 00:31:55,190
♪ And it brings me hope ♪

287
00:31:55,800 --> 00:32:01,440
♪ There is nowhere left
for darkness to hide ♪

288
00:32:01,720 --> 00:32:03,030
It'll be too late if we don't leave now!

289
00:32:02,390 --> 00:32:10,810
♪ Dawn will find its way to your side ♪

290
00:32:12,100 --> 00:32:15,850
♪ And it will never fade away ♪

291
00:32:12,880 --> 00:32:13,750
Get in the car!

292
00:32:31,490 --> 00:32:37,310
♪ Come, tell me what you have to say ♪

293
00:32:37,330 --> 00:32:39,080
♪ And I know your answers ♪

294
00:32:39,290 --> 00:32:43,530
♪ Won't change much for me ♪

295
00:32:44,320 --> 00:32:47,290
♪ I have dreams of my own ♪

296
00:32:47,800 --> 00:32:51,710
♪ Like the rising sun ♪

297
00:32:52,430 --> 00:33:01,280
♪ They're in the distance
and in my heart ♪

298
00:33:01,680 --> 00:33:07,830
♪ This love, to you and me ♪

299
00:33:08,620 --> 00:33:11,530
♪ Is as light is to the night ♪

300
00:33:12,130 --> 00:33:16,380
♪ It once gave me hope ♪

301
00:33:16,740 --> 00:33:23,060
♪ There is nowhere left
for darkness to hide ♪

302
00:33:23,430 --> 00:33:29,780
♪ Dawn will find its way to your side ♪

303
00:33:30,100 --> 00:33:35,940
♪ This love, to you and me ♪

304
00:33:36,720 --> 00:33:39,360
♪ Is as light is to the night ♪

305
00:33:40,160 --> 00:33:44,860
♪ It gives me endless hope ♪

306
00:33:45,170 --> 00:33:52,350
♪ There is nowhere left
for darkness to hide ♪

307
00:33:52,380 --> 00:33:59,900
♪ Dawn will find its way to your side ♪

308
00:34:01,430 --> 00:34:04,720
♪ It won't fade away ♪

309
00:34:08,550 --> 00:34:13,639
♪ It will always be by your side ♪

310
00:34:29,280 --> 00:34:29,880
Boss.

311
00:34:31,150 --> 00:34:32,150
Cui Enxi is dead.

312
00:34:32,920 --> 00:34:34,320
The ledger was not on her.

313
00:34:38,190 --> 00:34:39,440
Why don't you die?

314
00:34:48,280 --> 00:34:49,590
I will die for you.

315
00:34:53,800 --> 00:34:55,150
With a face like yours,

316
00:34:55,179 --> 00:34:57,980
no wonder your wife
is still willing to be with you.

317
00:34:58,810 --> 00:34:59,590
Captain Du.

318
00:35:08,710 --> 00:35:10,190
Everything in the safe has been taken out.

319
00:35:10,190 --> 00:35:11,320
No ledger was found.

320
00:35:25,230 --> 00:35:27,030
At least it wasn't a wasted trip.

321
00:35:31,850 --> 00:35:32,440
Here.

322
00:35:34,240 --> 00:35:35,300
Give it to the boys.

323
00:35:35,730 --> 00:35:36,860
Thank you, Captain.

324
00:35:37,280 --> 00:35:38,710
We didn't find the ledger.

325
00:35:38,710 --> 00:35:40,760
How do we explain this to Director Li?

326
00:35:40,760 --> 00:35:41,880
If I counted on you,

327
00:35:42,000 --> 00:35:43,860
I would have died many times over.

328
00:36:34,240 --> 00:36:35,300
The ledger is gone.

329
00:36:37,070 --> 00:36:38,470
But Su Men is still alive.

330
00:36:41,840 --> 00:36:43,920
I want to shut her up forever.

331
00:36:45,320 --> 00:36:47,720
The temporary detention
is only for 2 days.

332
00:36:48,230 --> 00:36:51,280
As long as we get the evidence
of Su Men colluding with the Communists,

333
00:36:51,280 --> 00:36:53,680
even Hua Liang
won't be able to protect her.

334
00:37:42,360 --> 00:37:43,280
You are Korean?

335
00:37:49,000 --> 00:37:50,400
If you have nowhere to go,

336
00:37:52,640 --> 00:37:53,970
stay with me from now on.

337
00:37:59,500 --> 00:38:00,660
You are pretty.

338
00:38:01,610 --> 00:38:03,210
I'll protect you from now on.

339
00:38:22,880 --> 00:38:24,140
Have a bowl of wontons.

340
00:38:24,840 --> 00:38:26,300
You haven't eaten all day.

341
00:38:31,880 --> 00:38:33,150
I want them...

342
00:38:35,260 --> 00:38:37,010
to pay in blood.

343
00:38:42,630 --> 00:38:44,490
Is there anything I can help with?

344
00:38:50,390 --> 00:38:50,980
Here.

345
00:38:53,480 --> 00:38:54,590
This thing.

346
00:38:54,670 --> 00:38:55,760
Captain Du said

347
00:38:56,510 --> 00:38:59,910
this is the evidence of Su Men
colluding with the Communists.

348
00:39:01,480 --> 00:39:03,610
Isn't this a little too half-hearted?

349
00:39:04,070 --> 00:39:05,930
You messed up her house like this.

350
00:39:06,280 --> 00:39:08,080
You know Inspector Su's temper.

351
00:39:08,230 --> 00:39:09,920
She may settle the score with you
after this.

352
00:39:09,920 --> 00:39:11,180
What are you thinking?

353
00:39:12,360 --> 00:39:14,150
Colluding with the Communists.

354
00:39:14,150 --> 00:39:15,230
Su Men is

355
00:39:15,680 --> 00:39:17,480
completely finished this time.

356
00:39:19,230 --> 00:39:20,960
Why didn't you come yesterday?

357
00:39:20,960 --> 00:39:23,290
There were a lot of good things yesterday.

358
00:39:24,110 --> 00:39:26,370
Alright. Go ahead and take the pictures.

359
00:39:36,200 --> 00:39:37,140
Raise your glasses!

360
00:39:37,140 --> 00:39:37,870
And you guys.

361
00:39:38,120 --> 00:39:38,730
Cheers!

362
00:39:38,760 --> 00:39:39,280
Come on!

363
00:39:40,110 --> 00:39:40,800
Director.

364
00:39:45,440 --> 00:39:47,370
Chen Kailai, what brings you here?

365
00:39:47,830 --> 00:39:49,630
I'm here to deliver some photos.

366
00:39:49,960 --> 00:39:51,190
I have an idea.

367
00:39:51,840 --> 00:39:53,300
You teach me photography,

368
00:39:53,360 --> 00:39:54,710
and I'll teach you how to do pedicures.

369
00:39:54,710 --> 00:39:55,230
What do you think?

370
00:39:55,230 --> 00:39:56,490
Pedicures? Forget it.

371
00:39:56,880 --> 00:39:57,680
Director Li.

372
00:40:04,800 --> 00:40:06,730
You use your art to serve your work.

373
00:40:07,190 --> 00:40:08,070
Well done.

374
00:40:09,110 --> 00:40:10,000
Good job.

375
00:40:10,710 --> 00:40:11,320
Sit here.

376
00:40:11,320 --> 00:40:12,450
I'll be leaving now.

377
00:40:12,890 --> 00:40:13,480
Sit.

378
00:40:17,320 --> 00:40:18,510
Danni, come here.

379
00:40:19,280 --> 00:40:20,410
Keep my bro company.

380
00:40:20,670 --> 00:40:21,400
Okay.

381
00:40:22,280 --> 00:40:23,550
Let's go dance.

382
00:40:23,550 --> 00:40:24,480
I don't know how.

383
00:40:24,890 --> 00:40:25,370
Come on.

384
00:40:25,400 --> 00:40:26,410
I... I really don't know how.

385
00:40:26,410 --> 00:40:27,410
I'll teach you.

386
00:40:27,440 --> 00:40:28,400
No, thanks.

387
00:40:29,110 --> 00:40:30,340
Then let's have a drink.

388
00:40:30,340 --> 00:40:31,340
I can't drink.

389
00:40:31,590 --> 00:40:34,030
I got some news from the Japanese.

390
00:40:34,510 --> 00:40:36,640
That woman will be released tomorrow.

391
00:40:41,800 --> 00:40:42,730
You are so drunk?

392
00:40:44,670 --> 00:40:45,400
Be careful.

393
00:40:48,440 --> 00:40:50,770
I heard something happened at Paramount.

394
00:40:52,320 --> 00:40:53,280
I remember

395
00:40:55,000 --> 00:40:57,530
the first time
I met Inspector Su on the train.

396
00:40:59,150 --> 00:41:00,150
She saved me.

397
00:41:02,880 --> 00:41:05,080
I didn't expect someone so influential

398
00:41:06,110 --> 00:41:07,240
to get into trouble.

399
00:41:09,500 --> 00:41:11,900
Why are you feeling sorry
for that traitor?

400
00:41:12,510 --> 00:41:14,570
Don't tell me you like that demoness.

401
00:41:16,710 --> 00:41:18,640
From Li Musheng's death until now,

402
00:41:22,070 --> 00:41:22,840
it feels

403
00:41:23,840 --> 00:41:25,190
like a lifetime.

404
00:41:28,360 --> 00:41:29,400
My cousin,

405
00:41:30,510 --> 00:41:31,550
Mr. Zhao,

406
00:41:32,190 --> 00:41:33,030
Auntie—

407
00:41:34,400 --> 00:41:35,400
they all came

408
00:41:38,800 --> 00:41:39,710
and left.

409
00:41:43,480 --> 00:41:45,590
I feel like I'm living

410
00:41:47,150 --> 00:41:48,800
in a movie,

411
00:41:50,230 --> 00:41:51,000
or...

412
00:41:53,950 --> 00:41:56,140
a fading photograph.

413
00:42:00,920 --> 00:42:02,580
I think you've lost your mind.

414
00:42:03,000 --> 00:42:04,480
Save your sympathy.

415
00:42:05,070 --> 00:42:06,000
Sooner or later,

416
00:42:06,230 --> 00:42:07,070
I will die too.

417
00:42:11,880 --> 00:42:13,610
Don't forget you are my man now.

418
00:42:13,630 --> 00:42:15,280
You could get a mission at any time.

419
00:42:15,280 --> 00:42:17,610
There's no time for you to be sentimental.

420
00:42:33,180 --> 00:42:34,270
They're all gone.

421
00:42:37,510 --> 00:42:39,110
Who am I supposed to contact?

422
00:42:50,960 --> 00:42:51,630
Hello?

423
00:42:51,880 --> 00:42:53,360
Is this Fulai Photo Studio?

424
00:42:53,360 --> 00:42:54,590
May I speak to Mr. Chen?

425
00:42:54,590 --> 00:42:55,360
Speaking.

426
00:42:56,320 --> 00:42:59,440
Would it be convenient for you
to send over

427
00:43:00,150 --> 00:43:02,150
the photos Ms. Su took at your place?

428
00:43:03,190 --> 00:43:03,800
Who did you say?
